==== InsertAmmoStartSound ====
Parameter for weapons. The parameter specifies the sound that will be played when the reload starts.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
InsertAmmoStartSound = DoubleBarrelShotgunInsertAmmoStart,
</syntaxhighlight>

